STATEMENT: >>>
The whole-canon Board is denser than a person can read -- the operator's words
on 2026-09-01: too much data to be useful today; I need to get my arms around
the data to decide the best way to filter. Use the Perspective view to find
which cuts of the data earn a place on the canvas (by system, by type, by
neighbourhood, by state -- to be discovered, not presumed), then decide the
Board's filter model and supersede the no-filter clause of
REQ-SDOC-BOARD-MVP-READS-WHOLE-CANON with it. The explorer exists to answer
this question.
